*
!/.gitignore
.claude/
!*/
!docker-compose.yml
!/README.md
# AGENTS.md / GEMINI.md / CLAUDE.md are agent rule files, not stack configuration:
# they stay local, mirroring ~/.claude/rules/docker-stack-conventions.md.

# prometheus.yml is the counterpart of dashboard/docker-compose.yml: node-exporter
# runs with network_mode: host, so its scrape target must match. Tracking only the
# compose file would leave a fresh clone with a broken 'node' job.
!prometheus.yml
# Source of the "Homelab - homeserver" Grafana dashboard. NOT provisioning: the
# dashboard lives in grafana.db and stays editable from the UI; this is only what
# it was generated from, kept so it can be rebuilt.
!/dashboard/homelab-dashboard/**
projects/
website/
work/